SUMMARY:Bead Working Basics
DESCRIPTION:In a single 2 hour workshop you will learn how to use basic str
 inging material called Tiger Tail along with Crimp Beads to properly attac
 h clasps. You will complete 2 bracelets and a fun pair of hoop and bead ea
 rrings.\n\nIn this workshop students are encouraged to bring their own bea
 ds as individual tastes may vary (BYOBeads). A selection of very inexpensi
 ve beads will also be available to purchase during the workshop.\n\nIf the
  current session is sold out\, please check back as we add new dates regul
 arly.
