 n stone and finally set the stone in the setting.\n\n\n\nMaterials are inc
 luded in this class. We have a selection of sterling silver stock wire for
  band rings and round cabochon stones to choose from. You will have 30-50 
 mins for lunch each day during the workshop.\n\n\n\nIf the current session
  is sold out\, please check back as we add new dates regularly. To book fo
 r more than one person\, please change the quantity in your cart. If the q
 uantity does not change\, this indicates that the rest of the spots are fu
