URL:https://thedevilsworkshop.ca/workshops/glass-fusing-feb-21-2025/
SUMMARY:Glass Fusing
DESCRIPTION:\nIn a single 2.5 hour workshop\, you will make 3 dazzling fuse
 d glass pendants\, and can try hand painting your work for a different eff
 ect!\n\n\n\nPlease note\, this is not a glass blowing class!\n\n\n\nIn thi
 s workshop\, you will arrange pieces of coloured glass into your own uniqu
 e designs\, with the option to add hand painted elements. The real magic h
 appens behind the scenes\, as we heat your creations to fiery hot temperat
 ures in our kiln\; they come to life as a single\, fused piece of wearable
  art. This crafty class is well suited to beginners.\n\n\n\nYour work must
  be cooled slowly in an annealing kiln for several hours\, and we will cal
 l you when your finished pieces are ready for pickup.\n\n\n\nMaterials for
  your pendants and 3 different kinds of necklaces to hang them from will b
 e included.\n\n\n\nIf the current session is sold out\, please check back 
 as we add new dates regularly. \n\n\n\n(Note: the start date above indicat
 es our current availability. If you signed up for a workshop that is befor
 e this date\, it is now full\, please check your confirmation email for yo
 ur workshop date! When the current date has filled up\, we will post the n
 ext available date for the workshop.)\n\n\n\nAll materials are included. E
 xtra pendants for additional cost. \n\n\n\n\n\nRelated Workshops\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\nSee all Workshops\n\n
